  {
   "id": "uncertainty",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 2310,
   "width": 500,
   "height": 330,
   "color": "2",
   "text": "### Uncertainty<br><br>- Laboratory tasks are narrow proxies<br>- Extinction does not erase memory<br>- Therapy effects depend on protocol and population"
  },
  {
   "id": "hypothesis",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 560,
   "y": 2310,
   "width": 560,
   "height": 330,
   "color": "6",
   "text": "### Open questions<br><br>- How far does executive dysfunction belong in the definition of adult ADHD?<br>- How do conditioning principles scale to complex human behaviour?<br>- How much confidence is warranted in detailed autobiographical recall?"
  },
  {
